MODULE: NoLostWriteScanBelowFloor
TARGET: NoLostWrite
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the rebuild scans the source as of before its captured resume floor, so the entry at the floor is never applied
PERTURBS: RebuildScan

--- FIND
    /\ rbVal' = SrcState(rbTree)
--- REPLACE
    /\ rbVal' = StateAt(rbTree, rbFloor - 1)
--- END
